  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Was Nothin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Goin' Gets Tough From The Getgo, The**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The Concert is Over**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2001-01-02** (recommended): source not stated; 37 songs; 190 min [1]\n- **ween-2001-01-02-auburn-youth-jazz-ensemble-show-the-saint-asbury-park**: source not stated; 0 songs; 194 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Secret show, advertised under the name Auburn State Youth Ensemble [1]\n- Described as Glenn's last show; he rejoined the band on 2/7/02. Main set ran about 2h50m, encore 20 minutes [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2001-01-02**: Recorded with MBHO 630 microphones (card), through MP-2 preamp, Graham Patton ADC-20, MP-2, D-8, then CDR, EAC and FLAC [1]",
